# डेढ़ is a fully suppletive word for one-and-a-half, and as a clock
# reading it IS half past one -- en.wiktionary.org, entry “डेढ़”: “one and
# a half; 1.5” and “half past one; 1:30”.  It is a literal, never composed
# from a half-word plus एक, which is why it ships as a landmark at minute
# 90 of the day rather than as a fraction.
डेढ़
डेढ
